<title>HONG KONG: BZW names Gately head of Asian economics,strategy.</title>
<headline>BZW names Gately head of Asian economics,strategy.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Plc's BZW Asia said on Monday it appointed Pauline Gately as head of regional economics and strategy for Asia, effective from June 1.</p>
<p>Gately will join the firm from Merrill Lynch, where she was regional strategist for four years, BZW said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
